  "description": "U-Yeon is a reclusive web fiction writer. Her mundane life is changed forever when Princess Charlize Rod Crosel, a minor character in one of her bestselling web fictions, decides to take destiny into her own hands by kidnapping U-Yeon and bringing her into the fictional world. Will U-Yeon and Charlize be given the opportunity to change the future and find their happy ending? \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS, edited)",
